OL,3,GNEWSAWinter travel concerns over       
OL,4,Amaternity unit closure                 
OL,6,FWinter travel is "particularly"        
OL,7,Fconcerning for families impacted by the
OL,8,Ftemporary closure of a maternity unit, 
OL,9,Fthe chairwoman of a scrutiny committee 
OL,10,Fhas said.                              
OL,12,FBirthing services at North Devon       
OL,13,FDistrict Hospital in Barnstaple have   
OL,14,Fbeen suspended since 11 August due to  
OL,15,Fstaffing issues, with pregnant women   
OL,16,Fnow facing a 53-mile (85km) trip to    
OL,17,FExeter to give birth.                  
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
