OL,1,W5j 5Q555pjsjjj js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSAWinter travel concerns over       
OL,4,Amaternity unit closure                 
OL,6,FJess Bailey, chairwoman of Devon       
OL,7,FCounty's Health and Adult Care Scrutiny
OL,8,FCommittee, said the journey was already
OL,9,F"hugely difficult" but travel          
OL,10,Fdisruption could make it "increasingly"
OL,11,Fhard.                                  
OL,13,FThe Royal Devon NHS Trust said it      
OL,14,Frecognised winter travel was "an       
OL,15,Fadditional worry for families already  
OL,16,Fhaving to travel further for maternity 
OL,17,Fcare".                                 
